GoogleTest 1.18.0, upstream googletest/include and googletest/src directories.
https://github.com/google/googletest/releases/tag/v1.18.0
License: ../gtest-LICENSE (upstream BSD 3-Clause).

../gtest.h and ../gtest-all.cpp preserve the project's existing include/build
entry points. SCons compiles only the aggregate gtest-all.cc translation unit.
The test data file ../data/gtest_h_original.txt is an unchanged older upstream
header extracted from ../data/gtest_h.zip; it is deliberately independent of
the framework sources used to compile the tests.
